  "description": "## 💀Vanguard💀\n \n### ✨ Features\n- Active main guild (Once you reach cl lvl 100 you can join it)\n- Selfmade world boss timer via discord\n- Guild armory\n- Awesome raiding progression from CL25 to CL92\n \n### ✔️ Requirements\n- **CL 80**\n- Help fulfill challenges and participate in both raids\n\n### 📅 Raid Schedule (CL80)\n- **17:00 CET** \n- **19:00 CET** \n \n ### 💬 Discord\n- Join our discord server to apply, get news &amp; information and chat with us: https://discord.gg/kCKdJmckxC\n\n ### 🏰 Other Forgotten Guilds\n- Forgotten CL 100+\n- Forgotten Watch CL 92\n- Forgotten Dawn CL 60-79\n- Forgotten Order CL 40 - 59\n- Forgotten Tavern (Pool guild)",
